<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-28T00:08:55.860Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:08:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;BSF troops shot dead a Pakistani intruder attempting to cross the border in Punjab, while Pakistani soldiers were attacked in Balochistan, resulting in four deaths and seven injuries. The UK Army Chief visited the Pakistan-Afghanistan border amid regional security tensions, and Saudi and Turkish officials arrived in Pakistan for trilateral defence talks linked to the Saudi-Houthi escalation in Yemen, where a Saudi aircraft struck a residential building in Taiz. Taliban forces in Afghanistan killed six young men from Panjshir after they failed to stop at a checkpoint, and Pakistan downed a Taliban drone that violated its airspace. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTFBxdlFYbUxxdFJTT1pBeHVtTXhhZi1GQWtoUjFhMTB2WTFzSjBoeDg2NjFCMnVNVjBGS3NnVUsyTnNVSXhLMm9Vbk15TThwU1lkQkMySDlETVdBbmdSZUhKOXhheU1aTTNLOFVDUlB0X3J3ODM1VTNqUXFqRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaama Press&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNWTlKMEhVM0xGcFE4SHA1SGRzNm1BMVRwbDA0TTBucHpucXRrNWtQTkFyN19tVkE1TWtOMTQzVVpjSG4yWmxsQ1Z2R0hGOW5xT1R1WjdqZ2VZbGVNMGlGVEFBeDFtQlVNcGI4ZzNZSVZBcmJXT0tKbHJEdzkybmF5bVNZUU14SUhrT19kZHpjT2dYVVBIdkRqdmlUeUJVRHpYT1FJT2pmaEVCVG5ZUVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;times of islamabad&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNOFBWM2ZUZ3hnQTZDRnRjeHh2U2VVcDdDYVVFOTVSb2hVd1kxRHhRZ3FlZHlJQ3FoMl84a1FvbjZndG1McDE4WUVndXplUGNjSjhwVFp4ZU9MMV9pNndNMmR3eTU0bkpsZFpCVjRSa0JKbU13MzVXdkl3V1F1UWVES2lSNnE5NThZTEdWLTdSOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National Interest&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cU